{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809da7","chatId":"d06aa0b48162490cbe6f3edfb00edb4a","sessionId":null,"userId":68107,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":845,"promptTokens":1483,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:36"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035925811769515702,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809d9f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369696655,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809d9f","chatId":"d06aa0b48162490cbe6f3edfb00edb4a","sessionId":null,"userId":68107,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小薇最近从中国来了德国当交换生。今天早上，阿飒，她的德国同班同学，邀请她去看一个电影，电影7点半开始。在欧洲，不像在中国，电影通常晚20到30分钟开始播放。小薇8点才到，不过阿飒什么也没说。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，阿飒最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 无感\nB) 反对\nC) 尴尬\nD) 气恼\nE) 紧张\nF) 开心\n\n## 问题 2\n阿飒为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 在德国文化中，看电影迟到是很常见的\nB) 魏莉对她的文化没有尊重\nC) 她习惯了交换学生的这种行为\nD) 阿飒不喜欢魏莉，也不在乎她迟到。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035925811769515702,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809da7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369696653,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c040492b12714b48a71cbeb4c1257f07"}